      "content": "but it's not just a feeling. i actually sat there with a calculator and looked at everything. the debt, the cost of my insurance, even just the food i eat... if i wasn't here, that money goes straight to them. it's basic math. i'm literally costing them their future. how is it \"anchor\" when you're just pulling them under?",
