    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "it's just so exhausting trying to prove i'm worth it every single day. i'm just so tired of fighting a losing battle. sometimes it feels like the only way to actually be selfless and stop causing them pain is to just... let go. to just stop being the problem. wouldn't it be more peaceful for everyone if the struggle just ended?",
